<sect1 id="release-4-2-12">
 <title>Release 4.2.12</title>
  <note>
   <title>发布日期</title>
   <simpara>2023-01-23</simpara>
  </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>概述</title>
  <para>
   本版本包含一个安全修复。
  </para>
  <para>
   如果满足以下所有条件，<xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-user"> 的密码会通过 <xref linkend="SQL-SHOW-POOL-STATUS"> 命令暴露。该命令可以被任何能够连接到 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 的用户执行。（CVE-2023-22332）
  </para>

  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <para>
     版本 3.3 或更高版本。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
    <xref linkend="guc-use-watchdog"> 为 <literal>on</literal>。
     </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
    <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-method"> 为 <literal>query</literal>。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
    A plain text password is set
    to <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-password">.
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>

  <para>
   In this case it is strongly recommended to upgrade to this version
   (we do not expose <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-password"> in
   show pool_status command any more), or use one of following
   workarounds.
  </para>

  <para>
   针对 4.0.x 至 4.4.x 用户的解决方法：
  </para>

  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <para>
    Disable watchdog. Set <xref linkend="guc-use-watchdog">
    to <literal>off</literal>.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
    Change <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-method">
    to <literal>heartbeat</literal>.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
    Set an empty string
    to <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-password">. This will use
    password in the <filename>pool_passwd</filename> file.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
    Set an AES encrypted password
    to <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-password">.
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>

  <para>
   In any case we recommend to
   change <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-password">
   in <productname>PostgreSQL</productname>.
  </para>

  <para>
   针对 3.0.x 至 3.7.x 用户的解决方法：
  </para>

  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <para>
    Disable watchdog. Set <xref linkend="guc-use-watchdog">
    to <literal>off</literal>.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     Change <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-method">
     to <literal>heartbeat</literal>.
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>

  <para>
   In any case we recommend to
   change <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-password">
   in <productname>PostgreSQL</productname>.
  </para>

  <para>
   Please note that <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 3.7.x or
   before are end of life and no minor updates are provided for those
   versions.
  </para>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>变更</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
	2023-01-21 [123ceb46]
      -->
    <para>
     不在 <xref linkend="SQL-SHOW-POOL-STATUS">、
     <xref linkend="PCP-POOL-STATUS"> 和
     <xref linkend="PGPOOL-ADM-PCP-POOL-STATUS"> 命令中暴露 <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-password">。（CVE-2023-22332）（Bo Peng）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
	2023-01-21 [4e0cb44b]
      -->
    <para>
     将 <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-password"> 的默认值改为空字符串，与文档一致。（Bo Peng）
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

