    -->
    <para>
     修复发生 ERROR 时 <xref linkend="GUC-CHILD-MAX-CONNECTIONS"> 未被遵守的错误。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id="release-4-2-1">
 <title>Release 4.2.1</title>
 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2020-12-23</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>变更</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-12-22 [5b9a29c]
    -->
    <para>
     将所有 <filename>pgpool.conf</filename> 示例中的套接字路径改为 "/var/run/postgresql"。（Bo Peng）
    </para>
   </listitem>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-12-14 [3dc4cb2]
    -->
    <para>
     在 Pgpool 父进程中使用单个共享内存段存储所有共享变量（Muhammad Usama）
    </para>
    <para>
     共享内存段是一种有限的资源，应避免打开过多的段。
    </para>
   </listitem>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-12-08 [db613fd]
    -->
    <para>
     启动时删除任何预先存在的 watchdog 命令套接字文件（Muhammad Usama）
    </para>
    <para>
     Patch provided by Masaya Kawamoto
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>Bug 修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-12-22 [a180302]
    -->
    <para>
     文档：为 "5.3. Clustering mode" 添加缺失的原始模式并修复拼写错误。（Bo Peng）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-12-21 [2aa234d]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <command>pcp_pool_status</command> 和 <command>SHOW POOL_STATUS</command> 命令中与心跳相关的不正确结果。（Bo Peng）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-12-18 [e7d9477]
    2020-12-18 [86ee4d6]
    -->
    <para>
     文档：修复安装提示章节中 <command>firewall-cmd</command> 的用法。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
    <para>
     <command>firewall-cmd</command> opened unnecessary ports in the example.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-12-15 [59d7431]
    2020-12-13 [00d103f]
    -->
    <para>
     Fix segfault that may occur when backend_flag = 'ALWAYS_PRIMARY|ALLOW_TO_FAILOVER' or failover_command = ''.
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=672">bug 672</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-12-14 [83355dd]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <xref linkend="WD-CLI"> 和 watchdog lifecheck 机制中不一致的 watchdog node_id 问题。（Muhammad Usama）
    </para>
    <para>
     When pgpool node 0 (leader watchdog) is shutdown, all of the pgpool nodes terminate abnormally.
     This commit fixed this issue.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-12-13 [cf668fa]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 watchdog 被禁用且未定义 <varname>wd_port</varname> 时的错误。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-12-04 [3bd83aa]
    -->
    <para>
     Fix compiler error on FreeBSD.
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=670">bug 670</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     补丁由 ajs.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-11-30 [86d4dd0]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <filename>pool_passwd</filename> 中的文件交换竞态条件。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
    <para>
     补丁由 Masaya Kawamoto.
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id="release-4-2-0">
 <title>Release 4.2.0</title>
 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2020-11-26</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>概述</title>
  <para>
   本版本添加了许多增强，以便更轻松地配置和管理。此外，新增的集群模式不仅允许多个 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 服务器之间的写一致性，还允许读一致性。同时改进了 SSL，以允许更安全的操作。引入了新的 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 13 <literal>SQL</literal> 解析器。
  </para>

  <para>
   请注意，本版本中一些配置参数已改为使用更恰当的语言。报告中使用的某些词语也相应更改。更多详情请参阅"Migration"章节。
  </para>

  <para>
   以下是主要增强。
  </para>

  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <para>
     Some items in the configuration file
     <filename>pgpool.conf</filename> are vastly enhanced for easier
     configuration and administration.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     Implement <xref linkend="guc-logging-collector"> for easier log
     management.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     Implement <xref linkend="guc-log-disconnections"> to collect
     disconnection logs.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     Implement <xref linkend="PG-ENC"> and <xref linkend="PG-MD5"> to
     allow to register multiple passwords at once.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     Allow to show statistics of health check by using <xref
     linkend="SQL-SHOW-POOL-HEALTH-CHECK-STATS"> command, and also
     allow to show statistics of issued SQL by using <xref
     linkend="SQL-SHOW-POOL-BACKEND-STATS"> command.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     新增 PCP 命令 <xref linkend="PCP-RELOAD-CONFIG">。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     Now it is possible to omit <xref
     linkend="guc-write-function-list"> and <xref
     linkend="guc-read-only-function-list"> by looking at system catalog
     information.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     Add new clustering mode <xref
     linkend="guc-snapshot-isolation-mode"> which guarantees not only
     data modifications to multiple
     <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> but read consistency.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     Support LDAP authentication between clients and
     <productname>Pgpool-II</productname>.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     Add <xref linkend="guc-ssl-crl-file"> and <xref
     linkend="guc-ssl-passphrase-command"> to SSL configuration.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     引入 PostgreSQL 13 的 SQL 解析器。
    </para>
  </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>迁移到版本 4.2</title>

  <itemizedlist>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tatsuo Ishii <ishii@sraoss.co.jp>
2020-03-09 [f0fe8fe9] Unify master_slave_mode, master_slave_sub_mode and replication_mode into backend_clustering_mode.
-->
    <para>
     master_slave_mode, master_slave_sub_mode and replication_mode are
     deprecated and replaced by <xref
     linkend="guc-backend-clustering-mode">. Please change them as
     follows.
     <itemizedlist>

      <listitem>
       <para>
       master_slave_mode = 'on', master_slave_sub_mode = 'stream' &rarr; backend_clustering_mode = 'streaming_replication'
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
       master_slave_mode = 'on', master_slave_sub_mode = 'logical' &rarr; backend_clustering_mode = 'logical_replication'
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
       master_slave_mode = 'on', master_slave_sub_mode = 'slony' &rarr; backend_clustering_mode = 'slony'
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
       replication_mode = 'on' &rarr; backend_clustering_mode = 'native_replication'
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
       replication_mode = 'off', master_slave_mode = 'off' &rarr; backend_clustering_mode = 'raw'
       </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
<!--
2020-09-17 [9e366c14]
-->
    <para>
     语言清理。（Umar Hayat）
    </para>
    <para>
     在 <filename>pgpool.conf</filename> 中进行了以下更改。
     <itemizedlist>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	black_function_list &rarr; write_function_list
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	white_function_list &rarr; read_only_function_list
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	black_query_pattern &rarr; primary_routing_query_pattern
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	black_memcache_table_list &rarr; cache_unsafe_table_list
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	white_memcache_table_list &rarr; cache_safe_table_list
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	ALWAYS_MASTER flag &rarr; ALWAYS_PRIMARY flag
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	follow_master_command  &rarr; follow_primary_command
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	Replace relcache_query_target option value 'master' to 'primary'.
       </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>
    </para>

    <para>
     Some words used in reporting are changed.

     <itemizedlist>
      <listitem>
       <para>
	master &rarr; main
       </para>
       <para>
	slave &rarr; replica
       </para>
      </listitem>
      </itemizedlist>
    </para>

    <para>
     Some parameter names used in scripts are changed.

     <itemizedlist>
      <listitem>
       <para>
	master &rarr; main
       </para>
      </listitem>
      </itemizedlist>
    </para>

    <para>
     Some names used in watchdog are changed.

     <itemizedlist>
      <listitem>
       <para>
	master &rarr; leader
       </para>
      </listitem>
      </itemizedlist>
    </para>

   </listitem>

<!--
Author: Bo Peng <pengbo@sraoss.co.jp>
2020-08-11 [a840ecb2] New feature: Simplify Watchdog related configuration parameters.
-->
   <listitem>
    <para>
     以下 watchdog 参数已被弃用。
     <programlisting>
    - wd_hostname
    - wd_port
    - wd_heartbeat_port
    - heartbeat_device
    - heartbeat_destination0
    - heartbeat_destination_port0
    - heartbeat_destination1
    - heartbeat_destination_port1
    - other_pgpool_hostname0
    - other_pgpool_port0
    - other_wd_port0
    - other_pgpool_hostname1
    - other_pgpool_port1
    - other_wd_port1
     </programlisting>
     Use below parameters instead.
     更多详情请参阅 <xref linkend="config-communication-watchdog">。
     <programlisting>
     hostname0 = 'server1'
     wd_port0 = 9000
     pgpool_port0 = 9999
    
     hostname1 = 'server2'
     wd_port1 = 9000
     pgpool_port1 = 9999
    
     hostname2 = 'server3'
     wd_port2 = 9000
     pgpool_port2 = 9999
    
     heartbeat_hostname0 = 'server1'
     heartbeat_port0 = 9694
     heartbeat_device0 = ''
    
     heartbeat_hostname1 = 'server2'
     heartbeat_port1 = 9694
     heartbeat_device1 = ''
    
     heartbeat_hostname2 = 'server3'
     heartbeat_port2 = 9694
     heartbeat_device2 = ''
     </programlisting>
      Unlike 4.1 or before, now all watchdog parameters are identical
      on all hosts.  To distinguish which host is which, create a file
      <filename>pgpool_node_id</filename> and put number 0, 1, 2
      etc. to identify host.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <para>
     <xref linkend="guc-write-function-list"> and <xref
     linkend="guc-read-only-function-list"> are now both empty.
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>

 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>Bug 修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <para>
     In this release same bug fixes as <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 4.1.4 are
     already applied. 有关这些修复的更多详情，请参阅 <xref linkend="release-4-1-4">。
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>主要增强</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-11-25 [935e045]
    -->
    <para>
     从 ereports 中移除 strerror() 调用。（Muhammad Usama）
    </para>
    <para>
     调用 ereport() 会重置 errno 值，使用 "strerror(errno)" 会发出错误的错误消息。正确的方法是改用 %m 格式说明符。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-03-09 [f0fe8fe9]
    2020-09-01 [82d77612]
    -->
    <para>
     Unify master_slave_mode, master_slave_sub_mode and
     replication_mode into <xref
     linkend="guc-backend-clustering-mode">. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-11 [a840ecb2]
    -->
    <para>
     简化 Watchdog 相关配置参数。（Bo Peng）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-06-20 [b0f976be]
    -->
    <para>
     允许使用配置设置指定单位。（Muhammad Usama）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-03 [3996850a]
    2020-06-29 [d2888d59]
    2020-06-27 [35037bcd]
    -->
    <para>
     添加 <xref linkend="guc-logging-collector">。（Muhammad Usama，日语文档由 Tatsuo Ishii 编写）
    </para>
    <para>
     引入 PostgreSQL 的日志收集器。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-24 [86778775]
    -->
    <para>
     允许通过 <xref linkend="guc-log-disconnections"> 收集断开连接日志。（Takuma Hoshiai）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-06-25 [37772c5b]
    2020-04-07 [d8434662]
    -->
    <para>
     Allow to set application name parameter of <xref
     linkend="guc-log-line-prefix"> in more cases. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     <xref linkend="guc-log-line-prefix"> 中的 %a 仅在启动消息中指定了 application_name 时才会设置。现在，如果在连接参数或 SET 命令中设置了 application_name，也可以设置它。
    </para>
    <para>
     同时在各种内部进程中设置了硬编码的 application_name，以便管理员可以轻松识别每条日志行属于哪个进程。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-03 [afbcff6f]
    -->
    <para>
     Change <xref linkend="PGPOOL-SETUP"> so that <xref
     linkend="guc-log-line-prefix"> includes application name. (Tatsuo
     Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-03-18 [78c217cd]
    -->
    <para>
     Add support for an user/password input file to <xref
     linkend="PG-ENC">. (Umar Hayat, Japanese doc by Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-04-06 [68d66a66]
    -->
    <para>
     Add support for an user/password input file to <xref
     linkend="PG-MD5">. (Umar Hayat, Japanese doc by Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-14 [9f74a228]
    2020-08-14 [689a8fcc]
    2020-08-14 [f04ef82b]
    2020-08-14 [d23f0af7]
    2020-08-14 [1afc6431]
    2020-08-17 [644c0898]
    2020-08-17 [241ff0f2]
    2020-08-18 [4b512891]
    -->
    <para>
     添加 <xref linkend="SQL-SHOW-POOL-BACKEND-STATS">。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
    <para>
     新命令显示自 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 启动以来执行的 SQL 命令数和后端返回的错误数。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-01-27 [c36a2804]
    2020-01-26 [cb35c9b8]
    2020-01-26 [154d826b]
    -->
    <para>
     Add <xref linkend="SQL-SHOW-POOL-HEALTH-CHECK-STATS"> to show
     health check statistics (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-02-24 [42919f2e]
    -->
    <para>
     新增 PCP 命令 <xref linkend="PCP-HEALTH-CHECK-STATS">。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-02-25 [dfc56868]
    -->
    <para>
     新增 pgpool_adm 函数 <xref linkend="pgpool-adm-pcp-health-check-stats">。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-06-04 [c13a630f]
    2020-06-03 [9e979b7f]
    2020-05-21 [987b6994]
    -->
    <para>
     New PCP command <xref linkend="PCP-RELOAD-CONFIG"> for reloading
     the pgpool configuration (Jianshen Zhou, Muhammad Usama, Japanese
     doc by Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-05-04 [87e6e11c]
    2020-05-06 [b859969c]
    -->
    <para>
     Allow to stop whole pgpool cluster by using <xref
     linkend="PCP-STOP-PGPOOL"> command. (Muhammad Usama, Japanese doc
     by Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-09-24 [6156534a]
    -->
    <para>
     添加 wd_cli 实用程序（Muhammad Usama，日语文档由 Tatsuo Ishii 编写）
    </para>
    <para>
     <xref linkend="wd-cli"> 使外部健康检查系统与 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 的集成更加容易。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-02 [b7f902d9]
    -->
    <para>
     通过检查 volatile 属性实现自动写入函数检测。（Tatsuo Ishii、Hou、Zhijie）
    </para>
    <para>
     如果通过检查系统目录发现 SELECT/WITH 中包含的函数具有 volatile 属性，则将其视为写入函数。此功能仅在 <xref linkend="guc-write-function-list"> 和 <xref linkend="guc-read-only-function-list"> 都为空时才可用。black_function_list 和 white_function_list 的默认值现在为空字符串，因此此功能默认启用。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-26 [fc9fa8db]
    -->
    <para>
     在多个位置增强获取函数名称的方式。（Hou、Zhijie）
    </para>
    <para>
     启用查询缓存后，<productname>Pgpool-II</productname>
     检查 SELECT 中的函数调用。但是，如果使用模式限定调用函数，则无法识别。此提交修复了在此情况下允许模式限定。
    </para>
    <para>
     此外，现在允许在 <xref linkend="guc-write-function-list"> 和 <xref linkend="guc-read-only-function-list"> 中使用模式限定的函数名。请注意，如果您想注册模式限定的函数名，您也必须注册不带模式限定的函数名。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-21 [761d30a1]
    -->
    <para>
     Add dml object level load balance support in <xref
     linkend="guc-disable-load-balance-on-write"> .(Subiao, Muhammad
     Usama)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-07 [cb34604d]
    -->
    <para>
     允许在 pgpool_adm 函数中使用参数名称。（Hou、Zhijie）
    </para>
    <para>
     Example:
     <programlisting>
     SELECT * FROM pcp_node_count(host => 'localhost', port => 11001, username => 't-ishii', password => 't-ishii');
     </programlisting>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-02 [537a2c1d]
    -->
    <para>
     添加按表/数据库 oid 使查询缓存失效的公共 API。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-06-26 [c18c12f8]
    -->
    <para>
     添加对客户端与 pgpool 之间 LDAP 认证的支持。（Takuma Hoshiai）
     更多详情请参阅 <xref linkend="auth-ldap">。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-05-23 [5bc38fe1]
    -->
    <para>
     增强 scram/md5 认证回归测试以使用 AES256 加密密码。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-01 [3f9a0a3d]
    2020-06-27 [d8f5c20d]
    2020-06-26 [8b472278]
    2020-06-22 [6f35af74]
    2020-06-20 [ff76762c]
    2020-06-20 [91e39bb0]
    2020-06-19 [22930861]
    -->
    <para>
     Add new <xref linkend="guc-backend-clustering-mode"> "snapshot
     isolation mode". (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     此模式类似于现有的原生复制模式，只是它在后端之间提供了更严格的读一致性（所谓的"原子可见性"），并会产生一种错觉，即由多个后端组成的集群看起来像一个单一的 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 服务器。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-05-22 [859080bd]
    -->
    <para>
     Add mention about hostssl/hostnossl to
     <filename>pool_hba.conf</filename> sample file. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     虽然支持 hostssl/hostnossl，但 <filename>pool_hba.conf</filename> 的注释中没有提及。
    </para>
   </listitem>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-04-01 [6ea15445]
    2020-03-31 [9ee3d93c]
    2020-03-30 [eb0c7c2c]
    2020-03-30 [a01c37d8]
    -->
    <para>
     Add support for <xref
     linkend="guc-ssl-passphrase-command">. (Umar Hayat, Japanese doc
     by Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-03-14 [dc3116c7]
    -->
    <para>
     Add support for <xref linkend="guc-ssl-crl-file"> (CRL:
     Certificate Revocation List). (Umar Hayat, Japanese doc by Tatsuo
     Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-05-18 [fc9e9d37]
    -->
    <para>
     Change relative path of SSL files to configuration
     directory. (Umar Hayat, Japanese doc by Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-04-28 [eee4c86c]
    -->
    <para>
     Allow to show appropriate process status by ps command with
     extend queries. (Takuma Hoshiai)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-04-26 [a2a6005d]
    -->
    <para>
     降级过于冗长的认证日志。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-30 [ef3d830f]
    -->
    <para>
     在认证过程中显示更具信息性的错误消息。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-02-10 [6222cb3a]
    -->
    <para>
     Suppress unnecessary error message when there's no standby
     server. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-01-28 [20baad9d]
    -->
    <para>
     Check if socket file exists at startup and remove them if PID
     file doesn't exist. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-01-10 [1062b805]
    -->
    <para>
     让 <command>pgproto</command> 学习通知响应消息。（Tatsuo Ishii）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-07 [86778775]
    -->
    <para>
     引入 PostgreSQL 13 beta3 的新解析器。
     Major changes of PostgreSQL 13 parser include:
     <itemizedlist>
      <listitem>
       <para>
	Remove an object's dependency on an extension
	<programlisting>
	 ALTER TRIGGER ... NO DEPENDS ON EXTENSION ...
	 ALTER FUNCTION ... NO DEPENDS ON EXTENSION ...
	</programlisting>
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	Allow FETCH FIRST to use WITH TIES.
	<programlisting>
	 FETCH FIRST ... WITH TIES
	</programlisting>
       </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
      <listitem>
       <para>
	Add ALTER TABLE clause DROP EXPRESSION
	<programlisting>
	 ALTER TABLE ... DROP EXPRESSION
	</programlisting>
       </para>
      </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	Allow setting statistics target for extended statistics
	<programlisting>
	 ALTER STATISTICS ... SET STATISTICS
	</programlisting>
       </para>
       </listitem>
-->
      <listitem>
       <para>
	Allow ALTER VIEW to rename view columns
	<programlisting>
	 ALTER VIEW ... RENAME COLUMN ... TO ...
	</programlisting>
       </para>
       </listitem>
<!--
      <listitem>
       <para>
	Add CREATE DATABASE clause LOCALE option
	<programlisting>
	 CREATE DATABASE ... LOCALE
	</programlisting>
       </para>
       </listitem>

      <listitem>
       <para>
	Add DROP DATABASE clause WITH FORCE option
	<programlisting>
	 DROP DATABASE ... WITH (force)
	</programlisting>
       </para>
       </listitem>
-->
      <listitem>
       <para>
	Add VACUUM clause PARALLEL option
	<programlisting>
	 VACUUM (PARALLEL 1) ...
	</programlisting>	 
       </para>
      </listitem>
     </itemizedlist>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-19 [51293488]
    2020-08-19 [7fecd5cd]
    -->
    <para>
     and <command>watchdog_setup</command> with PostgreSQL's bin path
     and lib path. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-17 [9c7c3047]
    -->
    <para>
     Use <command>pg_config</command> to get
     <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> lib path and add this path
     to LD_LIBRARY_PATH environment parameter in regress.sh. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>

    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-11 [88a72578]
    -->
    <para>
     Make RPMs to include <filename>pcp.conf</filename> and
     <filename>pool_hba.conf</filename> sample files. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-31 [d7c75781]
    -->
    <para>
     将 RPM 包的 PCP UNIX_DOMAIN_PATH 改为 "/var/run/postgresql"。（Bo Peng）
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-27 [680e4d67]
    -->
    <para>
     Rename src/redhat/pgpool_rhel7.sysconfig to
     src/redhat/pgpool_rhel.sysconfig to make this file available on
     RHEL8/CentOS8. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

